---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../site.js";
---
<Base title="Support" description="Sponsor Jordan Last's work on Millillion: open-source formal verification tools built with AI agents.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Support Millillion</h1>
    <p>I build open-source formal verification tools with AI agents, starting with Lasm (Lean for JavaScript and WebAssembly) and ProofScript. If this work is useful to you or you want to see it succeed, I'd appreciate your sponsorship. It supports me and the work on all of the Millillion projects.</p>
    <p>My first goal is $250 a month, enough for one dedicated Claude Code account for Lasm.</p>
  </article>
  <div class="box">
    <h2>Sponsor on GitHub</h2>
    <p>Sponsorship is monthly, through GitHub Sponsors.</p>
    <a class="cta primary" href={SITE.sponsors}>Sponsor on GitHub</a>
  </div>
  <div class="box">
    <h2>Other ways to help</h2>
    <p>Star the repos, try the projects, and report what breaks. Telling others about the work helps too.</p>
    <a class="cta" href={SITE.github}>Millillion on GitHub</a>
  </div>
</Base>
